id: P-add-case-study
name: Add a case study
description: Document a real project's journey with Paradigm — problem, solution, lessons, metrics
trigger:
  - case study
  - project journey
  - document experience
tags:
  - docs
  - case-study
  - retrospective
symbols: []
exemplar: docs/private/
steps:
  - action: create
    target: docs/private/case-studies/{name}.md
    notes: |
      Structure:
        # {Project Name} — Case Study
        ## Problem (what needed solving)
        ## Approach (how Paradigm was applied)
        ## Key Decisions (with rationale)
        ## Results (metrics, outcomes)
        ## Lessons Learned (what worked, what didn't)
        ## Protocols Discovered (patterns worth capturing)
  - action: verify
    notes: Ensure lessons are actionable and could inform future protocols or wisdom entries
